  "clustering": {
    "_comment": "Duplicate detection across sources, inverse-frequency weighted so rare tokens (pac-3, sentinel) count far more than common ones (lockheed, missile). Dollar figures are normalised into a shared token but can never create a match alone. Deliberately biased toward NOT merging: a false split only costs a corroboration bonus, a false merge silently deletes a story. Stable band is 0.45-0.60; 0.50 sits in the middle so corpus shifts don't flip behaviour.",
    "min_shared_tokens": 3,
    "overlap": 0.5,
    "tight_overlap": 0.99
  },
